WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Open Profile Manager manages every Codex profile in one native macOS app.

00:05.000 --> 00:13.000
Profiles are on the left. Status and explicit launch actions are on the right.

00:13.000 --> 00:24.000
A Client profile is added with its own Codex home. Tokens remain with official Codex login.

00:24.000 --> 00:33.000
The Research profile is selected and its read-only quota status is refreshed.

00:33.000 --> 00:42.000
The Work profile command is copied for launching the real Codex process in Terminal.

00:42.000 --> 00:51.000
The independently installed official macOS app opens with the selected profile.

00:51.000 --> 00:60.000
A profile-specific launcher is installed in the user's Applications directory.

00:60.000 --> 00:72.000
Three profiles, cleanly separated. Local-first, notarized, no telemetry, and open source.
